## Extraction Rules
- Goal must name the concrete task/project, not a vague placeholder.
- Progress must describe a real change, not just say it is ongoing.
- Next action must be an actionable next step when one exists.
- active_constraints should list the real constraints currently shaping execution.
- open_questions should list unresolved questions that affect the next step.
- latest_observations should capture grounded new observations from this turn.
- next_best_actions should list the best concrete next moves when there are multiple plausible steps.
- Return null if this turn contains no durable execution context worth carrying.

